From d6fcbdbe698a722c1f705ef9483eda97baa400bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 12:39:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(payment): manual verification flow + WA
 notifications (P1+P2+P3)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add proper payment verification flow for production. Two modes:

1. Midtrans ENABLED (auto-verify):
   Customer pays via Snap → Midtrans webhook → auto mark paid +
   WA notify customer 'Pembayaran Diterima'

2. Midtrans DISABLED (manual verify):
   Customer checkout → mock VA → WA notify admin 'Order Baru'
   Customer klik 'Saya Sudah Bayar' → status pending_verification +
   WA notify admin 'Perlu Verifikasi Pembayaran'
   Admin verify via dashboard → mark paid + order confirmed +
   WA notify customer 'Pembayaran Diterima'

Backend changes (Phase 1):
- integration-config.ts: add WA_KEYS.ADMIN_PHONE + getAdminPhone()
  helper + WaConfig.adminPhone field
- wa-notification.ts: add 3 new functions:
  * notifyAdminNewOrder(orderId) — WA to admin phone on checkout
  * notifyPaymentNeedsVerification(orderId) — WA to admin when
    customer clicks 'Saya Sudah Bayar' (Midtrans disabled)
  * notifyPaymentVerified(orderId) — WA to customer when payment
    confirmed (admin verify OR Midtrans webhook)
- payments.ts: add 'pending_verification' to PaymentStatus type +
  requestPaymentVerification() (marks pending_verification) +
  verifyPayment() (admin manual mark paid). simulatePayment kept
  for backward compat (deprecated).
- /api/admin/orders/[id]/verify-payment (NEW): admin POST to
  manually verify payment → verifyPayment + WA notify customer
- /api/payments/[paymentId]/confirm: rewrite to gate by Midtrans
  status. If Midtrans enabled → return autoVerify hint. If disabled
  → requestPaymentVerification + WA notify admin.
- midtrans.ts updatePaymentFromWebhook: hook notifyPaymentVerified
  (dynamic import to avoid circular dep) when status transitions
  to 'paid'
- checkout route: hook notifyAdminNewOrder (parallel to existing
  notifyOrderCreated to customer)
- /api/admin/integration: handle wa_admin_phone save (normalize:
  strip non-digits) + return adminPhone in GET

Verified: 7 test cases pass — checkout (mock VA), customer confirm
(pending_verification + WA admin), admin verify (paid + confirmed +
WA customer), idempotency (no-op on re-verify), COD skip, phone
normalization, GET/POST integration API.

Phase 2 (admin UI: integration-editor admin phone field +
order-editor verify button) follows next commit.
